Package: africanUrbanGrowthReview
Title: African Urban Growth Research — Systematic Review Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alvin", "Adu-Asare", , "alvinkofiaduasare@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analytical pipeline for a PRISMA-compliant systematic review of
    African urban growth research 2015-2025 (n = 183 studies).  Reproduces every
    figure, table and statistical test reported in the companion Nature Cities
    manuscript, plus the exploratory analyses performed during the review.
